    cme_runtime -->|wakes and evaluates affected authoritative state| grace
    grace -->|evaluates readiness/checkpoints| objective_state
    objective_state -->|records objective/stage events| river
    river -->|wakes reevaluation| grace
    grace -->|enqueues declared action| relay
    relay -->|creates bounded execution| execution_envelope
    execution_envelope -->|requests capability selection| providers
    verification -->|publishes only reconciled result| publication
    verification -->|emits completion/failure event| river
    river -->|completion/failure causes reevaluation| grace
    grace -->|redispatches ready work or escalates| relay
    grace -->|records no-ready/capacity/quiescence decision| diagnostics
    providers -->|provider completion is not global quiescence| grace
    steward -->|EMITS| flow_event_steward_seed_promoted
    river -->|CONSUMED/EVALUATED| cme_runtime
