    river -->|CONSUMED/EVALUATED| relay
    providers -->|EMITS| flow_event_provider_execution_completed
    river -->|CONSUMED/EVALUATED| verification
    providers -->|EMITS| flow_event_provider_execution_failed
    river -->|CONSUMED/EVALUATED| diagnostics
    river -->|CONSUMED/EVALUATED| verification
    relay -->|EMITS| flow_event_work_order_queued
    river -->|CONSUMED/EVALUATED| cme_runtime
    relay -->|EMITS| flow_event_work_order_completed
